      "description": "How far an agent has read an issue: `lastCommentId`, `lastUpdatedAt` and `checkedAt`, one file per issue — the marks say what was seen, never the comments. Two marks rather than one because an EDITED comment keeps its id (`issue-working`). `state`: a running process writes one each time it checks. REPOSITORY-scoped for the reason `beans/` and `todos/` are."
